  "context": [
    "Each file provides the vote counts for each choice (i.e., each candidate or referendum) per contest. Five vote counts are reported per entry: votes cast in-person on Election Day, votes cast absentee by mail, votes cast early via early voting sites, votes cast provisionally, and total votes cast. Data are provided per precinct (including real precincts and administrative precincts such as early voting sites).",
    "Contest information includes election date, contest title, and number of choices on the ballot. Candidate information includes name and party affiliation. Vote counts are broken down by county, precinct and voting method. See",
    "Table 1: North Carolina Results Data Files by Election Date",
    "Election Results Files by Election Date",
    "These files contain the results of an election after all accepted provisional and absentee ballots have been sorted into their respective precincts. See",
    "Table 2: North Carolina Precinct Sorted Results Data Files by Election Date",
    "Precinct Sorted Results Files by Election Date",
    "Table 3: North Carolina Certified Results Data Files by Election Date, Sorted by County and/or Contest",
    "Certified Election Results by Election Date"
  ]
}
